adaptation = "The report exposes these transformations as AlphaNet-v1 intermediate features, then applies trainable batch normalization and a neural-network ensemble whose learned gamma, beta, batch moments, weights, and random seeds are not published. The implementation therefore publishes the transparent pre-BN daily feature as a standalone factor, maps return1 to close_to_close_total_return_1d and free_turn to turnover_rate_f, uses pandas Pearson correlation or sample standard deviation (ddof=1), and uses hfq high/low to avoid corporate-action discontinuities. It is not a reproduction of the AlphaNet composite prediction."
